# Settings > Indicators: the status icon sets, as cards to pick from. The
# rows' titles are in settings.ftl.

## The statuses each card previews, under its marks.

settings-indicators-status-working = 工作中
settings-indicators-status-blocked = 受阻
settings-indicators-status-done = 已完成
settings-indicators-status-idle = 空闲
settings-indicators-status-unknown = 未知

## Each set's name, then one line on what sets it apart.

settings-indicators-set-dots = 圆点
settings-indicators-set-dots-description = 小圆点；工作时显示带旋转圆弧的圆环。
settings-indicators-set-solid = 实心
settings-indicators-set-solid-description = 带镂空标记的实心圆；空闲时显示月牙。
settings-indicators-set-outline = 轮廓
settings-indicators-set-outline-description = 相同标记的轮廓样式，带旋转的开放圆弧。
settings-indicators-set-tiles = 方块
settings-indicators-set-tiles-description = 每个标记位于按状态颜色着色的方块上。
settings-indicators-set-wave = 波浪
settings-indicators-set-wave-description = Superset 的波浪网格；每种状态都在网格单元中绘制。
settings-indicators-set-braille = 盲文
settings-indicators-set-braille-description = 盲文单元；受阻时逐点填充和清空。
settings-indicators-set-orca = Orca
settings-indicators-set-orca-description = Orca 的步进圆环、问号气泡和带圈对勾。
